    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <style>\n    /* Pixel-style theme: 4 colors */\n    :root {\n      --bg: #1a1c2c;\n      --card: #2a2d40;\n      --accent: #f4d03f;\n      --text: #f0f0f0;\n      --error: #e74c3c;\n      --shadow: #0f111a;\n    }\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    body {\n      background: var(--bg);\n      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 16px;\n      image-rendering: pixelated;\n    }\n    .calculator {\n      background: var(--card);\n      border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n      box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--shadow);\n      padding: 24px;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 400px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 16px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      color: var(--accent);\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      text-align: center;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--shadow);\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .input-group {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n    label {\n      color: var(--text);\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    input, select, button {\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      border-radius: 0;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: none;\n    }\n    input:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n      border-color: var(--text);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent);\n    }\n    input:invalid {\n      border-color: var(--error);\n    }\n    button {\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: var(--bg);\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border-color: var(--accent);\n      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--shadow);\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    button:hover {\n      background: var(--text);\n      border-color: var(--text);\n    }\n    button:active {\n      transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n      box-shadow: none;\n    }\n    .result-group {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n    output {\n      background: var(--bg);\n      border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n      padding: 12px;\n      font-size: 1.3rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      text-align: right;\n      min-height: 3rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      word-break: break-all;\n    }\n    .error {\n      color: var(--error);\n    }\n    [hidden] {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"calculator\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calc</h1>\n    <div class=\"input-group\">\n      <label for=\"left\">Left Number</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" id=\"left\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. -5\" aria-label=\"Left number\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"input-group\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Right Number</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" id=\"right\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. 3.5\" aria-label=\"Right number\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"input-group\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\" aria-label=\"Operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" aria-label=\"Calculate\">Calculate</button>\n    <div class=\"result-group\">\n      <label for=\"result\">Result</label>\n      <output id=\"result\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  const leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\n  const rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\n  const operationSelect = document.getElementById('operation');\n  const calculateBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\n  const resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  const showError = () => {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    resultOutput.classList.add('error');\n  };\n\n  const showResult = (value) => {\n    resultOutput.textContent = value;\n    resultOutput.classList.remove('error');\n  };\n\n  const calculate = () => {\n    const leftRaw = leftInput.value.trim();\n    const rightRaw = rightInput.value.trim();\n\n    if (leftRaw === '' || rightRaw === '') {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const left = Number(leftRaw);\n    const right = Number(rightRaw);\n\n    if (!Number.isFinite(left) || !Number.isFinite(right)) {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const operation = operationSelect.value;\n    let result;\n\n    switch (operation) {\n      case 'add':\n        result = left + right;\n        break;\n      case 'subtract':\n        result = left - right;\n        break;\n      case 'multiply':\n        result = left * right;\n        break;\n      case 'divide':\n        if (right === 0) {\n          showError();\n          return;\n        }\n        result = left / right;\n        break;\n      default:\n        showError();\n        return;\n    }\n\n    if (!Number.isFinite(result)) {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    showResult(result);\n  };\n\n  calculateBtn.addEventListener('click', calculate);\n\n  // Optional: Enter key triggers calculation\n  [leftInput, rightInput, operationSelect].forEach(el => {\n    el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n      if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n        calculate();\n      }\n    });\n  });\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Calculator\n\nA simple offline pixel-style calculator that performs basic arithmetic on two numbers.\n\n## Features\n\n- Input two numbers (left and right). Supports negative and decimal values.\n- Select an operation: add, subtract, multiply, or divide.\n- Click \"Calculate\" or press Enter in any input to compute the result.\n- Displays the numeric result only, or the exact text \"Error\" for invalid inputs (empty, non-finite, or division by zero).\n- Fully keyboard accessible with labeled controls.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server, packages, or network required.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure and styles\n- `script.js` – calculation logic\n- `README.md` – this file\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
